From c555b4eea949d82b55995249cb8ed8ba4a70e46d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tbrasselle <tbrasselle@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(ui): the machine page button row fits a 720 px window

The Refresh button shares the Library combo row instead of taking a
row of its own. The row lays out right to left, so the combo cannot
push the button out of the cell. One reclaimed row is about 28 px;
the action row sat 8 px under the fold of a 1280x720 window since
the ribbon grew in #2027.

Pinned by the_machine_page_buttons_fit_without_scrolling_at_720_px
and the updated layout_page_setup_machine anchors.

Fixes #2105
